source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: Jira consumes the backslash and then resolves nothing for the target it reads, showing an error span; jiro reads the decoded target and keeps the link reversible as a directive, as it does for every target this instance cannot resolve.
-- input.jira --
[x|JIRA-1\?focusedId=2]
-- rendered.html --
<p><span class="error">&#91;x|JIRA-1\?focusedId=2&#93;</span></p>
-- want.md --
:link[x]{target="JIRA-1?focusedId=2"}
-- warnings.json --
[]
